  "body": "## Security\n\n- SQL Server connections now verify the server's TLS certificate. Local servers work as before, and for a self-signed remote server sqlit asks once whether to trust it. #346\n- Updated locked dependencies with known vulnerabilities in `uv.lock`. This affects development and CI only. #345\n\n## Features\n\n- Leader-menu commands can be bound directly to keys in `action_keys`. Thanks @fclef819 for the request. #326, #321\n- New Vesper dark theme. Thanks @mihaicrisann. #327\n\n## Bug fixes\n\n- Text in BLOB columns shows as text again instead of hex, and cell previews with text like `[/api/v1]` no longer crash. Thanks @sykesab. #329, #328\n",
